{"articleNo":"131955","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=131955&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관]2015-1학기 오름관2동 공공요금 정산 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.07.16","hit":"3833","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2015-1학기 오름관2동 공공요금 정산 안내</span></strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">오름관</span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">동의 공공요금은 사용량에 따라 실비 정산하는 시스템입니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">공공요금은 매월 사용량을 검침하여 익월 말경 고지에 의해 납부하게 됩니다</span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">위의 일정을 감안하면 </span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기말 사용기간</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(6.14~6.20)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">의 공공요금이 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">6</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월분으로 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">7</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월말에 고지되어 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월에 정산이 이루어지게 됩니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">따라서 </span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 공공요금의 최종 정산은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일까지 완료하여 사용자에게 공지하고 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">31</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 까지 정산금액을 환불 또는 추가 징수할 예정입니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">다만</span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">사용자의 공공요금예치금에 대한 과부족 여부</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">판단을 돕기 위해서 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3-5</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월분 정산내역을 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">7</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">20</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일까지 생활관 홈페이지를 통해 안내할 예정입니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">공공요금의 계량</span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">고지</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">납부 등의 업무일정을 이해하여 주시기 바라며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">최대한 신속하게 처리하도록 노력하겠습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">오름관</span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">동 운영사 세안텍스</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">관리소장 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">전화 </span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">054) 479-4300~1</span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
